/Pg 11 0 R
/K [39]
>>
endobj
210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 731 0 R
/E (Adaptive Cognitive Therapy Hub: Analyzes two metrics in real-time:Response Latency \(ms\) + Error Rate \(%\). If 3 consecutive fails occur, difficulty downgrades to prevent frustration. If 3 passes occur, difficulty upgrades to promote neuroplasticity. TensorFlow Lite MLP predicts cognitive fatigue from session patterns to auto-suggest breaks.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [40]
>>
endobj
211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 732 0 R
/E (Secure Life Story Vault \(Memory Gallery\): Locally encrypted \(AES-256 SQLCipher\) vault stores family photos & familiar faces. Implements Cognitive Stimulation Therapy \(CST\) protocols to ground identity during confusion. Optional cloud sync via Firebase \(caregiver-controlled\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [41]
>>
endobj
212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 733 0 R
/E (DPDP-Compliant Offline Structure: AES-256 SQLCipher encrypts all local data. Opt-in Firebase sync \(caregiver controls what leaves device\). Multi-factor Firebase Auth for caregiver login. Patients have one-click "Wipe All Data" button for right-to-be-forgotten. Zero unencrypted data exposure at any layer.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [42]
>>
endobj
